    "answer": {
      "short": "Matching groups: $2t,\\ 3t-t,\\ t+t$; $t^2,\\ t\\times t$; $0.5t,\\ \\frac{t}{2}$; $2+t,\\ t+2$. No match: $t$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}t+t&=2t\\\\3t-t&=2t\\\\t\\times t&=t^2\\\\0.5t&=\\frac{t}{2}\\\\2+t&=t+2\\end{align*}$$\nThus $2t$, $3t-t$ and $t+t$ all match. The other matching pairs are $t^2$ and $t\\times t$, $0.5t$ and $\\frac{t}{2}$, and $2+t$ and $t+2$. The expression $t$ has no match.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
